  {
    "episode_id": 84654,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84654.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "All right, thank you. And I do want to talk about your primary win, something that made a lot of news. It was very important. You actually beat out a 30-year incumbent Elliot Engel during the primary election. Take us through how you did it. Did you know it was going to happen? What was your strategy on the win?",
