  {
    "episode_id": 84654,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84654.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Wonderful. And I wanted to talk to you about the COVID-19 pandemic because you were elected during the pandemic and you actually be going to office as the pandemic continues. What are your feelings about what's going on? And also, I just want to make a mention that the Bronx has been hit very hard by the COVID-19 pandemic when it comes not just to the health, but also economically. Tell me your feelings and your take on what's going on. What do you think?",
