  {
    "episode_id": 84654,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84654.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Yes, I know he can be defeated. But it's going to take all of us across this country to organize and make sure we do everything we can to get everyone out to vote. It's going to be different because we're in the middle of a pandemic, so we're pushing support for mail-in ballots. to make sure everyone gets their can get their vote in that way and those who are going to the polls were pushing to have better investment and resources there so people are now waiting our lives for two or three hours but absolutely Trump can be defeated but it's going to take all of us so anyone listen to this if you have family and friends in swing states like Florida, Virginia, Ohio, Michigan, In other spaces, we need you to make sure that you help organize, to give people out to vote. Because as I mentioned, President Trump is dangerous, and God forbid we have another four years of him. I can't even fathom what might happen if we continue to let this man occupy our White House. So yes, he can be defeated. But also key is flipping the Senate. So there are about five or six So senatorial race is right now. Democrat versus Republican. And if Democrats can take back the Senate and own the White House, the Senate and the House of Representatives, we can really push forward some urgent bold reform across this country.",
